<p>Dear <%= @owner.try(:username) || @owner.try(:email) %>,</p>

<p>Your deposit has been successfully confirmed. Your wallet balance has been updated.</p>

<div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Deposit Receipt</h3>
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="font-size: 14px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">Transaction Reference:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @deposit.metadata&.dig('transaction_ref') || @deposit.id %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">Payment Gateway:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; text-transform: capitalize;"><%= @gateway %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">Date:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @deposit.completed_at&.strftime('%B %d, %Y %H:%M UTC') || Time.current.strftime('%B %d, %Y %H:%M UTC') %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">Amount Credited:</td>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; color: #10b981;">
        $<%= format('%.2f', @amount) %> USD
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p>Your wallet balance has been updated and is ready to use for your next purchase.</p>

<p>View your balance: <a href="<%= ENV['FRONTEND_URL'] %>/dashboard/billing" style="color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none;">Go to Billing</a></p>

<p>Best Regards,<br>The ProxySock Team</p>
